# Appendix

Background pages you can skip if you already write Roc and HTML. Canonical
behavior stays in [reference](/docs/reference/).

- [Roc for Rocci](/docs/appendix/roc-for-rocci/) — Roc names and types used from templates
- [Web foundations](/docs/appendix/web-foundations/) — HTML, HTTP, and Datastar at the level this manual assumes
- [Glossary](/docs/appendix/glossary/) — terms that appear on more than one path
